ive that breathes life into the art.\n\nWhether you’re an art enthusiast, a history buff, or simply seeking inspiration, our tour of the Art Institute promises an unforgettable experience. Unleash your imagination and let our highly trained guides help you explore the major artworks.\n\n**Highlights usually Include:** (unless on loan or being restored, etc.)\n- Hartwell Memorial Window – Tiffany Studios\n- Paris Street; Rainy Day – Gustave Caillebotte\n- Sunday on La Grande Jatte – Georges Seurat\n- The Bedroom – Vincent van Gogh\n- Sky Above Clouds – Georgia O’Keefe\n- Nighthawks – Edward Hopper\n- A Picture of Dorian Gray – Ivan Albright\n- American Gothic – Grant Wood\n- America Windows – Marc Chagall\n- The Old Guitarist – Pablo Picasso\n- Four Mona Lisas – Andy Warhol\n- Greyed Rainbow – Jackson Pollock\t\t\t\t\t\n\n##Included\t\t\t\t\t\n- Skip-the-line museum tour\n- Private professional tour guide just for you\n- Tour includes all entrance fees\n\t\t\t\t\n##Not Included\t\t\t\t\t\nGratuities \t\t\t\t\n\t\n##What to bring\t\t\t\t\t\nComfortable clothes and shoes", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "For all ages! • 2.5 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/chicagomuseumtours/items/520236/images/1127189/", "pk": 1127189, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kdJ5VSQJCqtxu3uIHnwH", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kdJ5VSQJCqtxu3uIHnwH", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/chicagomuseumtours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/chicagomuseumtours/items/520236/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kdJ5VSQJCqtxu3uIHnwH", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.co